185
00:11:42.728 --> 00:11:46.358
informed approach, and I just wanted to know if you could explain to the

186
00:11:46.408 --> 00:11:48.128
committee what that involves.

187
00:11:49.468 --> 00:11:53.308
In one minute. We're working with the compliance teams who

188
00:11:53.328 --> 00:11:57.248
enact the bylaws in Auckland City, and what that is is about how they engage

189
00:11:57.268 --> 00:11:58.568
