financial hardship, mental distress, addiction, family violence,

2523
02:36:52.670 --> 02:36:56.630
relationship breakdown, as well as people leaving prisons, hospitals,

2524
02:36:56.670 --> 02:36:59.590
and state care without stable housing.

2525
02:36:59.630 --> 02:37:03.110
What is notably absent from that list is personal preference.

2526
02:37:03.760 --> 02:37:06.610
People are not choosing homelessness.

2527
02:37:07.470 --> 02:37:11.330
It's an outcome of multiple system failures colliding in a person's life.

2528
02:37:12.150 --> 02:37:15.350
So finally, I ask you to consider where public money is best

2529
02:37:15.450 --> 02:37:19.190
