3751
03:48:41.770 --> 03:48:42.480
What do we say to them?

3752
03:48:42.540 --> 03:48:45.490
Well, I need a bit more information on the specific circumstance.

3753
03:48:45.519 --> 03:48:49.190
So are the people who are outside, are they being aggressive and disruptive to

3754
03:48:49.250 --> 03:48:51.799
