03:48:51.799 --> 03:48:53.770
Sometimes. Not blocking, but aggressive.

3756
03:48:53.790 --> 03:48:54.700
Not blocking, but they're being aggressive still?

3757
03:48:54.710 --> 03:48:57.560
But not always aggressive. Sometimes they're just sitting there begging, like you

3758
03:48:57.560 --> 03:48:57.730
