3764
03:49:08.730 --> 03:49:08.739
Okay.

3765
03:49:08.750 --> 03:49:11.760
So that could be dealt with, and the police could visit and speak to them about

3766
03:49:11.810 --> 03:49:12.070
that.

3767
03:49:12.370 --> 03:49:12.400
Yeah. So then you can-

3768
03:49:12.410 --> 03:49:15.239
But that's our position. We don't think free speech should be violated, for

3769
03:49:15.239 --> 03:49:15.239
example-

3770
03:49:15.850 --> 03:49:19.650
But what about the restaurant owner, yeah? That has a mortgage to pay.

3771
03:49:20.420 --> 03:49:20.420
Yeah.

3772
03:49:20.450 --> 03:49:23.160
And people are telling you, "I'm sorry, we don't feel comfortable." You spoke about

3773
03:49:23.230 --> 03:49:26.810
