3791
03:50:14.680 --> 03:50:15.350
They never see the

3792
03:50:16.170 --> 03:50:16.660
light of day.

3793
03:50:17.630 --> 03:50:20.950
And perhaps that would mean that shoplifting would not happen so much.

3794
03:50:21.170 --> 03:50:23.070
But that would be a gross violation of their rights.

3795
03:50:23.110 --> 03:50:26.930
So it's a balancing act in terms of the rights of different people, and the

3796
03:50:26.990 --> 03:50:30.830
government can't just use a hammer to deal with quite a delicate

3797
03:50:30.910 --> 03:50:32.750
solution. That's my response.

